  "description": "A powerful .NET Standard 2.0 library for INotifyPropertyChanged with configurable behavior and extended event arguments. Track old/new values, switch between API and Client modes. Intuitive Set(value, ref backingField) API works with traditional backing fields or C# 13 field keyword (in .NET 8+ apps). Thread-safe, zero-reflection, broad compatibility. Now with comprehensive test suite (49 tests, 100% coverage).",
